{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Praise|strong=\"H1984\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"!  \nPraise|strong=\"H1984\", you servants|strong=\"H5650\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \npraise|strong=\"H1984\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s name|strong=\"H8034\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Blessed|strong=\"H1288\"be|strong=\"H1961\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s name|strong=\"H8034\",  \nfrom|strong=\"H5704\"this|strong=\"H6258\"time|strong=\"H6258\"forward and|strong=\"H3068\"forever|strong=\"H5769\"more|strong=\"H5704\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"From|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H3068\"rising|strong=\"H4217\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"sun|strong=\"H8121\"to|strong=\"H5704\"its|strong=\"H1984\"going|strong=\"H8121\"down|strong=\"H3996\",  \nthe|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s name|strong=\"H8034\"is|strong=\"H3068\"to|strong=\"H5704\"be|strong=\"H3068\"praised|strong=\"H1984\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"high|strong=\"H7311\"above|strong=\"H5921\"all|strong=\"H3605\"nations|strong=\"H1471\",  \nhis|strong=\"H3605\"glory|strong=\"H3519\"above|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H3605\"heavens|strong=\"H8064\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Who|strong=\"H4310\"is|strong=\"H3068\"like|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", our|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H3068\",  \nwho|strong=\"H4310\"has|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3068\"seat|strong=\"H3427\"on|strong=\"H3427\"high|strong=\"H1361\",   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"who stoops down|strong=\"H8213\"to|strong=\"H7200\"see|strong=\"H7200\"in|strong=\"H8064\"heaven|strong=\"H8064\"and|strong=\"H8064\"in|strong=\"H8064\"the|strong=\"H7200\"earth|strong=\"H8064\"?   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"He raises|strong=\"H6965\"up|strong=\"H6965\"the|strong=\"H6965\"poor|strong=\"H1800\"out|strong=\"H6965\"of|strong=\"H6083\"the|strong=\"H6965\"dust|strong=\"H6083\",  \nand|strong=\"H6965\"